        out[d]={"TITLE":title,"PURPOSE":purpose,"TODAY":today,"READY":f'<p>Open {link(f[key]["id"],"the student packet")} and <a href="{u[d]}">the private Canvas activity</a>.</p>',"MEDIA":media(imgs) if imgs else "","STEPS":steps,"EXIT":f"<p>{exit}</p>","DONE":done,"SUPPORT":"<p>evidence = evidencia · pathway = programa/ruta · preparation = preparación · limitation = limitación · revision = revisión · support = apoyo.</p>","FALLBACK":"<p>Missing old pages, a family interview, H&amp;L, a partner, or a platform does not equal failure. Use the documented recovery, conference, fixed-source, recording, AAC, typed, annotated, dictated, enlarged-print, or paper route. Do not submit private profile/contact/family data.</p>"}
